tains a detached aura and calmly watches over the growth of the girls at the academy. She usually leads a rather leisurely life, playing chess with Sieg or wandering around the academy with a bag of snacks in hand."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems to be interested in Tsukasa and occasionally tries to contact him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42055"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"このウィザーディア魔法学院の長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見は幼い少女だが、実は熟達の大魔術師である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に超然とした雰囲気を身にまとっており、のほほんとした様子でこの学院の少女たちの成長を見守っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はジークを相手にチェスをしたり、茶菓子の入った袋を手にしたまま学院内をぶらついたりと割と暇そうな生活を送っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ツカサのことが気になるようで、時折接触を持ってくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3083","sourceWorkId":"4551","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d1a872ec9dd07e58a0ca9b5ad320b405b700800d867e3ca1453942a01d1ac09.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c1a1cb41c25bf95acfecbe1fb9147b69ed04823aaf181603e54a720c365a3b5e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大波 こなみ","creatorId":"vndb:s260","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s260","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s260","name":"幡宮 かのこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3144","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c44590","characterName":"クリフ・ヴァーンガルド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c44590"},"originalCharacterName":"クリフ・ヴァーンガルド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters